# CHIME CIRCUIT: losing. When a CPU pilot wins the tournament, the podium
# says the cup goes to it and there is no ending: A goes back to the title.
# No Saucer and no Alien; without a race won there is no Beacon either.
# A race lost plays the losing jingle.
seed 20
game chime
wait 30
cheat cup 1
wait 25
press A
wait 5
cheat finish 1 2 3 4 5 0
wait 5
expect music_is.chm_also == 1
wait 55
press A
wait 25
press A
wait 25
press A
wait 25
press A
wait 5
